Phase 6 — Project Testing
Test Case 1 — Valid Input

Input: Correct user information
Expected: Personalized workout plan generated.

Test Case 2 — Missing Input

Input: Required field left empty
Expected: User receives appropriate validation/error message.

Test Case 3 — Invalid Input

Input: Invalid value
Expected: Application handles it without crashing.

Test Case 4 — API Failure

Condition: Gemini/API unavailable
Expected: Application displays an appropriate error message instead of crashing.

Test Case 5 — Different Fitness Goals

Input: Different fitness goals
Expected: Generated response should correspond to the selected goal.

Test Case 6 — Different Intensity

Input: Different intensity levels
Expected: Generated plan should reflect the selected intensity.

Testing Types
Functional testing
Input validation
Error handling
API failure handling
Performance checking
